text When I said that you...
sound MHV.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Are the kind of person who would never do those kinds of things...
text *Hurk*
text My body tenses.
text I never thought that Nagisa would ask me something like that... Especially after the lights are off.
sound MHW.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text My father seemed incredibly surprised.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's because he thought you meant something else...
text @[Tomoya]
text And it's true, regardless...
text @[Tomoya]
text You wouldn't want to do those kinds of things anyway, right...?
