text I did mean something else.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh...?
sound MHY.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I meant that you would never do something like what my dad does as a joke to my mom.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, yeah. I know that. I figured that out.
