label s230
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound MI5.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text What should we do...?
sound MI6.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...Should I... take the lead?
sound MI7.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Because, um... I'm the older one.
text I've never heard of it being common knowledge that someone should take the initiative just because they're older.
text But this must be Nagisa's way of doing everything she can.
text It must be her way of trying to be considerate of me, especially because she thinks I've had to hold in my desires.
text I can tell that Nagisa has gotten up and that she's closer to me now.
sound MI8.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Are you listening, Tomoya-kun...?
text She whispers into my ear.
text If I tell her "yes, please," then...
text Something may happen that we can never take back.
text Part of me feels scared.
text But I love Nagisa...
text And if there's something she'd do for me...
text Of course I'd want her to do it.
text But do I deserve that kind of thing right now?
text Am I working hard enough to have earned it?
text I don't know...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text Agh, I need to answer soon...
sound MI9.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Umm...
text Before I can make my decision... Nagisa begins to speak.
sound MIA.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm coming in.
text My top blanket is peeled back... and Nagisa slips into my futon.
text She must think that my silence is out of consideration for her.
text I have to say something.
text But I'm unable to do anything; it's as if I'm paralyzed.
text *Rub* *Rub*
text Nagisa moves around inside the futon.
text She moves right up to my body... and puts her arm around my back.
text I feel her body heat on my upper body.
text It feels incredibly hot.
text I've never been in such close contact with her.
text We're stuck together.
text My heart beats louder and louder.
text Each beat reverberates throughout my body.
text My pulse is racing faster than it ever has in my life. I'm certain of it.
sound MIB.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
text Nagisa presses her nose to the back of my neck.
text Her breath is hot as it exits her nose... It feels as though my nape is burning.
text Not only that, she puts her strength into the arm around my body... and holds me.
music BGM08D.mp3
text That's all it takes for me to feel happier than I've ever felt before.
text I'm in Nagisa's arms.
text This is how much Nagisa loves me.
text Nagisa, the love of my life.
sound MIC.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
text And then... Nagisa stays there, still.
text I'm wrapped in both euphoria and tenseness.
text After a while, I notice something.
text This is everything that Nagisa can bring herself to do.
text When I realize that, I relax and unintentionally begin to laugh.
sound MID.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Um... Why are you laughing...?
text Nagisa brings her head away from mine to ask the question.
sound MIE.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun, you still think of me as a child.
sound MIF.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm older than you. I have more life experience.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, I know that.
sound MIG.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Then why did you laugh?
text @[Tomoya]
text Er... How do I put it... Because I'm happy.
sound MIH.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Oh... You're happy? ...That's good.
sound MII.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But I still think it's strange for you to be laughing.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then what do you want me to do? Should I start panting?
sound MIJ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That seems better than laughing...
text @[Tomoya]
text Then try holding me again.
sound MIK.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay...
text *Hug*
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...
sound MIL.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay...
text @[Tomoya]
text Hold me closer...
sound MIM.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Oh, okay...
text *Squeeze*
sound MIN.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text How's this...?
text @[Tomoya]
text It's great...
text All she's doing is holding me, but...
text @[Tomoya]
text You know... it'd be even more amazing if you could blow into my ear...
sound MIO.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay... I understand...
sound MIP.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text *Fwoo*
text @[Tomoya]
text Stronger...
sound MIQ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text *FWOO*
text ...Incredible.
text If someone else saw this happening, it'd probably look comical, but...
text This is the greatest form of affection we can share with one another right now.
goto 287
