text I just impulsively felt like holding you, Tomoya-kun...
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, I think it's fine that you hugged me...
sound MIZ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But you just said that you wanted to hold out.
text @[Tomoya]
text Wait, but that was about doing dirty stuff...
sound MJ0.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes, dirty things...
text Don't tell me...
text When she talks about dirty and perverted stuff, she means... hugging each other inside a futon at night...?
sound MJ1.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'll hold back too.
text ...It must.
text What a cute and innocent girl.
text Without thinking, I burst into laughter.
sound MJ2.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Why are you laughing?
text @[Tomoya]
text Because you're so cute.
sound MJ3.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Tomoya-kun, you still think of me as a child.
sound MJ4.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm older than you. I have more life experience.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, I know that.
text I've never heard of someone this cute talking about how much life experience they have.
sound MJ5.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You're still laughing.
text Instead of replying, I just hold out my arm and grab Nagisa's hand.
text I grip it tightly.
text That's enough to make me happy.
text @[Tomoya]
text I have to be up early tomorrow. I'm going to sleep.
sound MJ6.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay. Good night.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, good night.
text I close my eyes, her hand still in mine.
