sound MJL.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Cover up the circuit board and my hands. Don't let go.
text I open up the sheet and do everything I can to keep Yoshino-san covered.
text The rain begins to beat down on me mercilessly as gusts of wind try to peel off the sheet.
text But partway through, even the rain stops bothering me.
text Yoshino-san's skills are on a completely different level.
text He's doing the same kind of work that I've learned up until now, but everything from his speed to his accuracy makes it look like he's doing something completely different.
text Moreover, his completed wiring looks like something out of a textbook.
text Not only is the accuracy of his wiring indescribably good, I'm struck by the beauty of it as well.
text The smooth wiring paths he's created helps prevent short circuits and sparks.
text And he did it all in less than half the time it would take me to do the job.
